      "code": "dst->type = &UA_TYPES[typeIndex];\nret = Array_decodeBinary(&dst->data, &dst->arrayLength, dst->type);",
      "note": "First non-harness project statement on the witnessed path that turns attacker-controlled bytes into vulnerability-relevant parser state: the top-level `Variant` header selects `ExtensionObject` elements and dispatches the remaining payload into array decoding.",
      "kind": "source"
